{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、マザー牧場に行ってきました🐏"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKBVKC8W1ZHAV80YFF1KMG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n牛が出迎えてくれました🐃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな動物がいました!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKBWJ820AE91WWJHGQ0FQ4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nうさぎ🐰私の中の、飼ってみたい動物ランキング上位👑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショーを見ました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKBXGKSNDB3SHTJSKJAH0Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n馬が手を振ってるのが可愛かったです🐎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他には、\n羊のショーで、羊をたくさん見ました🐏🐏"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKBYFZ57ANWTMJPWRPAKZW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nこんなに種類があるんだ!\n羊をまとめる犬すごいなあ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKBZFBFWM1P4G2M1KMY6PT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n優秀な犬なんだろうな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だにを見つめるなーこ👀"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKC0K4HWQEZXZA01ZAMSYA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくれた!!💓"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKC1JVSKQZS4VGY3XT702N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だにとデートなう。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKC2J3ND7EHHWVAH61JVNB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯は、ジンギスカンでした🐏"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKC3HGN4SX7T52YEGYRR03","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n美味しかった!\n初めてジンギスカンを食べました。\n羊さん、ありがとう命の重みを感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスもたくさん食べました!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKC4V4377VFEFCEWVS3DKB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nやっぱりミルクが1番✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お土産はプリン🍮幸せでした。\nジェットコースターに乗ったり、射的をしたり楽しかった〜🔫\n射的は難しくて残念賞の飴玉でした🍬\nまたやりたいな!!上手になりたい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はどこに行こうかな!\n色んなところに行こうっと((((っ・ω・)っ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}